  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nTransitive (⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧)\nIntransitive pair: ⟦{潤|うるお}う→潤う：08181_uruou⟧\n\nSENSE 1 (Physical):\n- ⟦{肌|はだ}→肌：02243_hada⟧/⟦{唇|くちびる}→唇：03903_kuchibiru⟧/⟦{喉|のど}→喉：00977_nodo⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{潤|うるお}す (to moisten skin/lips/throat)\n- Used in skincare context\n\nSENSE 2 (Figurative):\n- ⟦{懐|ふところ}→懐：12631_futokoro⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{潤|うるお}す (to profit, make money - lit. to moisten one's pocket)\n- ⟦{心|こころ}→心：01321_kokoro⟧/⟦{生活|せいかつ}→生活：01443_seikatsu⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{潤|うるお}す (to enrich one's heart/life)\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{潤|うるお}う→潤う：08181_uruou⟧ (to be moist; to profit - intransitive)\n- ⟦{潤|うるお}い→潤い：08250_uruoi⟧ (moisture; benefit - noun)\n- {湿|しめ}らす (to dampen)\n- ⟦{渇|かわ}く→渇く：10965_kawaku⟧ (to be thirsty/dry - antonym of うるおう)",
